WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:09.713 --> 00:00:13.817
[Subtitles by danielsangeo]

00:00:16.086 --> 00:00:18.722
So, I'm the one that gets
to go through training.

00:00:18.722 --> 00:00:20.757
Ass-slappage.

00:00:23.827 --> 00:00:25.095
HOLOGRAM: Hello, and welcome to the
Hello!

00:00:25.095 --> 00:00:27.397
HOLOGRAM: Black Mesa Hazard Course,
Oh wait, you're not real.

00:00:27.397 --> 00:00:28.031
HOLOGRAM: where you will be trained

00:00:28.031 --> 00:00:28.832
HOLOGRAM: in the use of the

00:00:28.832 --> 00:00:30.834
HOLOGRAM: Hazardous Environment Suit.
Dammit.

00:00:30.834 --> 00:00:32.536
HOLOGRAM: I am your holographic assistant.

00:00:32.536 --> 00:00:34.104
HOLOGRAM: Let's begin by
Yeah, a holograph.

00:00:34.104 --> 00:00:36.006
HOLOGRAM: stepping into your suit.

00:00:36.006 --> 00:00:37.307
HOLOGRAM: You can see it suspended up

00:00:37.307 --> 00:00:37.741
HOLOGRAM: ahead of you.

00:00:37.741 --> 00:00:38.375
Jackasses.

00:00:38.375 --> 00:00:40.277
HOLOGRAM: If you see one of these buttons,

00:00:40.277 --> 00:00:41.044
HOLOGRAM: press it and--
Okay.

00:00:41.044 --> 00:00:42.145
HOLOGRAM: Hello, and welcome to the

00:00:42.145 --> 00:00:43.914
HOLOGRAM: Black Mesa Hazard Course,
Oh, come on!

00:00:43.914 --> 00:00:44.948
HOLOGRAM: where you will be trained
You tell me to press the button and

00:00:44.948 --> 00:00:46.783
HOLOGRAM: in the use of the
that just resets the audio?

00:00:46.783 --> 00:00:49.419
HOLOGRAM: Hazardous Environment Suit.
Yeah, that's great programming there, guys.

00:00:49.419 --> 00:00:50.387
HOLOGRAM: I am your holographic assistant.
This thing looks heavy.

00:00:50.387 --> 00:00:51.588
HOLOGRAM: Let's begin by...

00:00:51.588 --> 00:00:57.594
HEV: Welcome to the HEV Mark 4
Protective System.

00:00:57.594 --> 00:01:02.065
HEV: For use in hazardous
environment conditions.

00:01:02.065 --> 00:01:03.333
Hello?

00:01:03.967 --> 00:01:05.869
What's going on?

00:01:05.869 --> 00:01:08.071
Well, I guess I'm done with training, then.

00:01:08.071 --> 00:01:08.805
That was easy.

00:01:08.805 --> 00:01:10.507
[door opens]

00:01:10.507 --> 00:01:11.575
Ah.

00:01:11.575 --> 00:01:14.611
I am not impressed so far.

00:01:14.611 --> 00:01:18.515
HOLOGRAM: Moving around in your HEV
suit can be slightly disorienting at first.

00:01:18.515 --> 00:01:21.351
HOLOGRAM: Take a moment to familiarize
Whoa!  How is this being projected?

00:01:21.351 --> 00:01:23.620
HOLOGRAM: yourself with basic movement
I don't see any projectors.

00:01:23.620 --> 00:01:25.789
HOLOGRAM: and soon it will fit
you like a second skin.

00:01:25.789 --> 00:01:26.623
Yeah, nothing.

00:01:26.623 --> 00:01:28.825
HOLOGRAM: I will see you just
around the corner.

00:01:28.825 --> 00:01:30.994
Okay, well, that DOES impress me.

00:01:30.994 --> 00:01:32.996
Must be nanoemitters or something.

00:01:32.996 --> 00:01:34.264
I don't know.

00:01:34.264 --> 00:01:39.436
Man, tech like that kind of contrasts with
all this rusted metal and worn-down concrete.

00:01:39.436 --> 00:01:42.339
Maybe this training isn't a
joke.  Who knows?

00:01:42.339 --> 00:01:46.176
Well, I seem to be passing with
flying colors so far.

00:01:46.176 --> 00:01:48.378
Hm.  Bar-cage window.

00:01:48.378 --> 00:01:49.279
[lock jiggles]

00:01:49.279 --> 00:01:51.381
Ah, this must be the gimp closet.

00:01:51.381 --> 00:01:52.816
For after-hours.

00:01:52.816 --> 00:01:54.551
I don't think I'm going to
come back here.

00:01:54.551 --> 00:01:56.119
Too many weirdos.

00:01:56.119 --> 00:01:58.555
The only reason I'm here is
because everyone else on the team

00:01:58.555 --> 00:02:02.592
is too damned frail to do any
physical activity whatsoever.

00:02:02.592 --> 00:02:04.828
So, because I can lift a box,

00:02:04.828 --> 00:02:07.731
HOLOGRAM: The first move we will practice
I'm automatically the lab gopher.

00:02:07.731 --> 00:02:10.667
HOLOGRAM: in the Hazard Course
is basic jumping.

00:02:10.667 --> 00:02:13.203
HOLOGRAM: You will attempt to
get over this set of pipes

00:02:13.203 --> 00:02:15.839
HOLOGRAM: using only your run
and jump commands.

00:02:15.839 --> 00:02:17.240
HOLOGRAM: It helps to
"Commands", huh?

00:02:17.240 --> 00:02:19.009
HOLOGRAM: get a running start.
Who wrote this?

00:02:19.009 --> 00:02:21.144
HOLOGRAM: Watch me and
then try it yourself.

00:02:21.144 --> 00:02:24.681
That is damned impressive
holography, though. I'll give them that.

00:02:24.681 --> 00:02:26.249
Okay, bidibip-duh.

00:02:26.583 --> 00:02:28.885
Hup!  Hoo!  Hah!

00:02:28.885 --> 00:02:29.586
SCIENTIST: Good work!

00:02:29.586 --> 00:02:30.153
Who said that?!

00:02:30.153 --> 00:02:31.488
SCIENTIST: Those new suits can be tricky.

00:02:31.488 --> 00:02:32.055
Oh.

00:02:32.055 --> 00:02:33.490
SCIENTIST: Please proceed
to the next area.

00:02:33.490 --> 00:02:35.525
"Please proceed to the next area."

00:02:35.525 --> 00:02:38.495
I bet you've never done a hurdle
in your life, fat boy.

00:02:38.495 --> 00:02:40.597
Everyone here thinks they're an expert.

00:02:40.597 --> 00:02:43.800
HOLOGRAM: You will now duck
under the next set of obstacles.

00:02:43.800 --> 00:02:47.604
HOLOGRAM: Please note that crouching
will automatically shift your suit into

00:02:47.604 --> 00:02:48.872
HOLOGRAM: stealth-mode,
Riiiight...

00:02:48.872 --> 00:02:50.340
HOLOGRAM: minimizing movement noise.

00:02:50.340 --> 00:02:52.075
"Stealth-mode".

00:02:52.075 --> 00:02:54.544
That must be our marketing department's
way of saying we have

00:02:54.544 --> 00:02:57.080
rubber padding around
the knees of the suit.

00:02:57.080 --> 00:02:59.516
I bet this suit is expensive, though.

00:02:59.516 --> 00:03:01.818
Kind of makes me wonder why I need it.

00:03:01.818 --> 00:03:04.287
I don't disarm bombs for a living.

00:03:04.287 --> 00:03:07.357
SCIENTIST: Very good!
I hardly noticed you.

00:03:07.357 --> 00:03:09.059
SCIENTIST: Move on to the next area.

00:03:09.059 --> 00:03:10.894
Yeah, whatever, tubby.

00:03:10.894 --> 00:03:12.729
Don't make me come up there.

00:03:12.729 --> 00:03:14.431
Why is that guy watching me?

00:03:14.431 --> 00:03:17.267
Does he think I'm going to cheat
and cut through the pipes?

00:03:17.267 --> 00:03:19.436
HOLOGRAM: Now we will combine skills.
Oh!

00:03:19.436 --> 00:03:22.906
HOLOGRAM: You will need to jump,
duck, and then jump again.

00:03:22.906 --> 00:03:25.275
HOLOGRAM: This will prepare you
for the next room,

00:03:25.275 --> 00:03:28.278
HOLOGRAM: where you will have to
do both moves at the same time.

00:03:28.278 --> 00:03:29.746
No...

00:03:29.746 --> 00:03:31.381
Getting crazy now...

00:03:31.381 --> 00:03:32.749
Can I handle this?

00:03:32.749 --> 00:03:34.017
Should I duck or jump?

00:03:34.017 --> 00:03:35.051
I can't remember!

00:03:35.652 --> 00:03:37.020
SCIENTIST: Good work!

00:03:37.020 --> 00:03:38.855
SCIENTIST: You look prepared for
the next station.

00:03:38.855 --> 00:03:40.223
Don't patronize me!

00:03:40.223 --> 00:03:41.391
And who's that with you?

00:03:41.925 --> 00:03:44.461
What the hell?  There's a panel
of you people?

00:03:44.461 --> 00:03:46.696
You're going to start holding up
scores next?

00:03:46.696 --> 00:03:49.566
I expect 10s.
I'd better see 10s.

00:03:49.566 --> 00:03:51.334
HOLOGRAM: To get into these pipes,
Yeah, I think I get the idea.

00:03:51.334 --> 00:03:52.869
HOLOGRAM: you'll have to signal your suit
Don't worry about it.

00:03:52.869 --> 00:03:53.737
HOLOGRAM: to make a duck-jump.

00:03:53.737 --> 00:03:55.672
HOLOGRAM: You'll have to stand right
How stupid do they think we are?

00:03:55.672 --> 00:03:56.973
HOLOGRAM: at the mouth of the pipe,

00:03:56.973 --> 00:03:59.042
HOLOGRAM: and continue to press forward.
I guess pretty stupid,

00:03:59.042 --> 00:04:01.644
HOLOGRAM: Then, jump up, and while...
she's going into detail.

00:04:02.779 --> 00:04:05.415
And why are there pictures of
batteries inside the pipes?

00:04:05.415 --> 00:04:06.316
HOLOGRAM: Nice job!

00:04:06.316 --> 00:04:08.418
Damn straight it is!

00:04:08.418 --> 00:04:10.086
Who do they think is taking this?

00:04:10.520 --> 00:04:11.588
Oh.  Hah.

00:04:11.588 --> 00:04:13.123
Well, that's creative.

00:04:13.123 --> 00:04:15.959
Kind of like crawling backwards
through a mini-golf course.

00:04:15.959 --> 00:04:17.327
I've always wanted to do that.

00:04:17.327 --> 00:04:18.328
Be a hamster man.

00:04:18.328 --> 00:04:23.166
HOLOGRAM: Walk directly into the ladder,
look up and continue moving forward.

00:04:23.166 --> 00:04:26.269
HOLOGRAM: If you want to come
back down, just move backward.

00:04:26.269 --> 00:04:32.342
'To wipe your ass, first orient your hand
behind yourself, then move it forward.'

00:04:32.342 --> 00:04:33.710
'Or backward.'

00:04:33.710 --> 00:04:36.546
Honestly, who doesn't know how
to use a ladder?

00:04:36.546 --> 00:04:38.648
I mean, it's a ladder!

00:04:38.648 --> 00:04:41.818
Somehow, I don't think this program
is designed for the gifted.

00:04:41.818 --> 00:04:46.389
HOLOGRAM: The next three jumps get harder
each time, but they are quite possible.

00:04:46.389 --> 00:04:50.527
HOLOGRAM: Don't be surprised if
you miss the last one a time or two.

00:04:50.527 --> 00:04:53.196
HOLOGRAM: If you can make all
three in a continuous run,

00:04:53.196 --> 00:04:54.197
HOLOGRAM: you are doing well.

00:04:54.197 --> 00:04:55.565
I'm doing fantastic!

00:04:55.565 --> 00:04:56.399
Watch this.

00:04:56.399 --> 00:04:56.633
Hup.

00:04:57.167 --> 00:04:58.034
Yeah!

00:04:58.735 --> 00:04:58.968
Hup.

00:04:59.669 --> 00:05:00.470
YEAH!

00:05:00.737 --> 00:05:01.004
Hup.

00:05:01.404 --> 00:05:02.739
You filming this?

00:05:02.739 --> 00:05:02.939
Hup.

00:05:03.373 --> 00:05:04.541
HOLOGRAM: Great work!
I know.

00:05:04.541 --> 00:05:07.410
HOLOGRAM: Now there is one more
style of jumping you need to learn.

00:05:07.410 --> 00:05:11.581
"Oh, rabbit style.  But only a training
course master can perform that."

00:05:11.581 --> 00:05:14.484
HOLOGRAM: Long jumping requires
its own charging module,

00:05:14.484 --> 00:05:15.685
HOLOGRAM: seen here.
Cool!

00:05:15.685 --> 00:05:19.489
HOLOGRAM: To activate your long jump,
you will have to duck and move forward,

00:05:19.489 --> 00:05:21.658
HOLOGRAM: and then launch into a jump.

00:05:21.658 --> 00:05:23.393
HOLOGRAM: Once you're up on the platform,

00:05:23.393 --> 00:05:25.929
HOLOGRAM: press the button and I
will demonstrate the move.

00:05:25.929 --> 00:05:27.764
Damn, this thing's bulky.

00:05:27.764 --> 00:05:30.066
Makes me wonder
what the hell it's used for.

00:05:30.066 --> 00:05:34.971
Man, I don't see any projectors and that
thing's running around like it's a ghost.

00:05:34.971 --> 00:05:38.241
Wish I had one for the lab; I
could scare the crap out of people.

00:05:38.608 --> 00:05:39.409
WHOA!

00:05:39.409 --> 00:05:41.978
HOLOGRAM: Nice job.
THAT WAS AWESOME!

00:05:41.978 --> 00:05:43.279
I'm doing that again.

00:05:44.347 --> 00:05:45.315
Wa-HOO!

00:05:45.315 --> 00:05:46.416
Hell yeah!

00:05:46.416 --> 00:05:49.619
Who needs a reason when this
module's that much fun to use?

00:05:49.619 --> 00:05:50.687
Nrreeeoow!

00:05:50.687 --> 00:05:52.322
That is sweet.

00:05:52.322 --> 00:05:54.524
Government funding kicks ass.

00:05:54.524 --> 00:05:56.593
I still want a hologram, though.

00:05:56.593 --> 00:05:58.695
How cool would it be
to set one up in the lab

00:05:58.695 --> 00:06:01.264
so that one of the
scientists walks in,

00:06:01.264 --> 00:06:02.365
sits down,

00:06:02.365 --> 00:06:03.700
starts working,

00:06:03.700 --> 00:06:07.737
I have a hologram of a homeless guy run
up to him and try and stab him with a knife.

00:06:07.737 --> 00:06:10.540
People would be spilling their
coffee, that's for sure.

00:06:10.540 --> 00:06:13.910
I could hide some speakers to make
an audio clip sync up with the hologram.

00:06:13.910 --> 00:06:17.647
Then they would hear the bum's footsteps
and him going, "YEENNNNNGGGH!"

00:06:17.647 --> 00:06:20.116
People would crap their pants, man.

00:06:20.116 --> 00:06:21.718
I'd need a hidden camera, too.

00:06:21.718 --> 00:06:24.387
HOLOGRAM: Please, start the lift
by moving up to the button,

00:06:24.387 --> 00:06:26.723
HOLOGRAM: looking at it and
pressing the use key.

00:06:26.723 --> 00:06:29.359
Sure. You want me to press a
button, I'll press a button.

00:06:29.359 --> 00:06:31.261
I could press buttons all day!

00:06:33.563 --> 00:06:36.299
HOLOGRAM: Now that you're up
here, there's only one way down.

00:06:36.299 --> 00:06:36.833
Where?

00:06:36.833 --> 00:06:40.303
HOLOGRAM: Find the target on the floor below
and do your best to hit it.

00:06:40.303 --> 00:06:40.937
What?

00:06:40.937 --> 00:06:43.106
HOLOGRAM: If you take
any damage from the fall,

00:06:43.106 --> 00:06:46.009
HOLOGRAM: we will administer
medical care at the next station.

00:06:46.009 --> 00:06:48.111
Heh, is this a joke?

00:06:48.111 --> 00:06:52.415
They want me to jump from this
height onto flat concrete?

00:06:52.415 --> 00:06:55.151
There must be a typo with the
instructions or something

00:06:55.151 --> 00:06:56.886
that no one corrected.

00:06:56.886 --> 00:07:00.156
I could climb down, but they
want me to hit that target.

00:07:00.156 --> 00:07:02.959
I'm not doing that.
That's retarded.

00:07:02.959 --> 00:07:06.029
So, I guess I failed the lemming
portion of the test,

00:07:06.029 --> 00:07:09.399
but hopefully that's not
required to pass the whole course.

00:07:09.399 --> 00:07:11.167
Well!  Training's over!

00:07:11.167 --> 00:07:13.436
I think I'll get out of here and
go take my lunch break.

00:07:15.705 --> 00:07:17.707
I'll just tell everybody
I passed training.

00:07:17.707 --> 00:07:19.033
No one's going to check this.

